  ExpressionUUID->"42ab7241-c1db-1afa-e5c4-603b3f11707b"],
 " be a finite irreducible Markov chain on labelled connected\ncubic \
multigraphs on the persistent vertex set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", "\[Ellipsis]", ",", "N"}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  TaggingRules-><|"MathNotebook" -> <|"SourceTeX" -> "\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}"|>|>,
  ExpressionUUID->"148c041b-9d36-580f-4a62-bc226ada45fc"],
 ", and assume\nthat every concrete Whitehead move available from a state has \
positive\ntransition probability.  Do not resettle between steps, and let"
}], "Theorem",
 CellDingbat->Cell[
   TextData[{"Theorem ", 
     CounterBox["Theorem"], "."}], FontWeight -> "Bold", FontSlant -> "Plain"],
 TaggingRules-><|
  "MathNotebook" -> <|
    "Environment" -> "theorem", "EnvironmentOpen" -> 
