\\frac{Q_A(B_N,B_0)}{\\min\\{\\pi_A(B_N),\\pi_A(B_0)\\}}.\n\\]", "Separator" -> 
     "\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"91ad853f-40ea-2a4c-20fa-b611e8791806"],

