Cell["\<\
A playable exact diffusion on the complete N=2,4,6 unlabelled quotients.  \
Blue fill is probability mass; the orange ring and trail are one sampled \
path.  SetReplace repeats singleton-hypergraph rules by Rule-A slot \
multiplicity.  Rule B uses one rule per support neighbour and pads every \
class to a fixed 3N clock with self-rules.\
\>", "Caption",
 ShowCellBracket->False,
 CellMargins->{{84, 84}, {2, 18}},
 TaggingRules-><|
  "MathNotebook" -> <|"Suppressed" -> "True"|>, 
   "GoGNotebook" -> <|
    "PresentationOnly" -> True, "ID" -> "GoGDiffusionLabCaption"|>|>,
 FontSlant->Plain,
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.37, 0.42, 0.49],
 CellTags->{
  "GoGNotebookVisual", 
   "GoGDiffusionLabCaption"},ExpressionUUID->"b43922a3-3ec5-fdd2-74b5-\
3ab4433415d4"],

Cell["\<\
The preceding field analysis uses the multiplicity-first Rule-A clock.  The
three base graphs also admit sharper, mutually incompatible conclusions.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|"MathNotebook" -> <|"Separator" -> "\n\n"|>|>,
 FontSlant->Plain,ExpressionUUID->"36597c51-deb5-f59d-819f-7d1597b79c49"],

